  <data name="AboutChangelogSync.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>✓ More reliable incremental sync&#x0a;WebDAV and local backup transfer only changed content.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutChangelogData.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>✓ Clearer data management&#x0a;Sync, data locations, import, backup, and recovery are managed together.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutChangelogNative.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>✓ Native Windows experience&#x0a;Built with WinUI 3, Windows App SDK, and the system Credential Locker.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutSoftwareTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>About This App</value></data>
  <data name="AboutSoftwareBody.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>AI Memory is a local-first work-memory tool for AI. It brings conversation history, memory rules, checkpoints, and handoff information from different AI Agents and command-line tools into one native workbench, helping you recover context, find past work, and continue from where you stopped.&#x0a;&#x0a;All core data is managed locally for privacy, reliability, and long-term availability.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutFooter.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Local first · Independent data · Native Windows 11</value></data>

